FORM before_deleting_tag.
  FIELD-SYMBOLS: <tag>     TYPE any.

  ASSIGN total+3(80) TO <tag>.

  SELECT COUNT(*) FROM ptf_var_tag_map WHERE tag = @v_ptf_var_tag-tag INTO @DATA(tagged_variants_count).
  IF tagged_variants_count > 0.
    MESSAGE w052(ptf) WITH v_ptf_var_tag-tag tagged_variants_count .
* If you delete tag &1, &1 variants will lose a tag.
  ENDIF.

ENDFORM.
